NOTICE

Binflare is an independent, clean-room
reimplementation of the zero-knowledge pastebin concept, written from
scratch for Cloudflare Workers. No source code from the upstream
project has been copied.

Upstream attribution
--------------------
This project was inspired by PrivateBin:

  - Repository:   https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin
  - Organization: @PrivateBin
  - Original author: Sebastien Sauvage
  - Copyright (c) Sebastien Sauvage and the PrivateBin contributors
  - Upstream license: Zlib/libpng
    (https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin/blob/master/LICENSE.md)

PrivateBin is a minimalist, open source online pastebin where the
server has zero knowledge of pasted data. This reimplementation follows
the same zero-knowledge principle (client-side encryption, key carried
only in the URL #fragment) but shares no code, no data format and no
assets with upstream. In particular, none of upstream's bundled
third-party libraries are used (including the GPLv2-licensed
rawinflate), and upstream's CC-BY-licensed logo/artwork is not used.

Data-format incompatibility
---------------------------
Pastes created by this project cannot be opened by upstream PrivateBin,
and upstream pastes cannot be opened here. The client-side encryption
formats differ. This is a new implementation, not a migration tool.

Non-affiliation
---------------
This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official port
of the PrivateBin project.
